› Explique la boucle d'agent et montre le code

● La boucle est un Stream d'AgentEvent.


  Elle rend la main à chaque frontière.







────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
› Ask Pyxis to do anything
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  / for commands                      @ for file paths
  ctrl + j for newline                enter to send
  tab to complete                     ↑ ↓ to browse history
  ctrl + a to go to line start        ctrl + e to go to line end
  ctrl + w to delete previous word    ctrl + u to clear the input
  ctrl + t to view transcript         ctrl + c to interrupt or exit

  ? or esc to close
